# Sub-tick spin of the gem glint (tests/harness/check_feeder_subtick.sh --path
# glint-rot). Rows: <bk2> | <V> | rec=<addr> [rtol=] [step=]. rec is the pool
# record whose drawn orientation is judged, in sine-table entries modulo 64.
#
# shady-oasis-flame.bk2 1897, rec 80067D00 (near star, 8.5 px extent): canon1895
# 41.08, canon1897 48.41, phase 169 to 177. With the replay rotating the corners
# against the routine's sense the alpha-0.5 ratio read 2.09 (the star turned the
# step the other way); with the routine's sense 0.09 LERPED.
shady-oasis-flame.bk2 | 1897 | rec=80067D00 rtol=0.25
# autumn-plains-skelos-badlands-portal-entry.bk2 1485, rec 80067D00 (near star,
# 50 px to 28 px extent, the largest in the movie): canon1483 1.03, canon1485
# 8.89, phase 193 to 201. 2.02 against the routine's sense, 0.02 with it.
autumn-plains-skelos-badlands-portal-entry.bk2 | 1485 | rec=80067D00 rtol=0.25
